  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Her Majesty Revenue and Customs (HMRC) support to the African Tax Administration FOrum (ATAF) to help strengthen the capacity of 6 African countries to implement and benefit from international tax deals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Her Majesty Revenue and Customs (HMRC) support to the African Tax Administration FOrum (ATAF) to help strengthen the capacity of 6 African countries to implement and benefit from international tax deals is a component of HM Revenue and Customs Technical Assistance to the African Tax Administration Forum reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;158,097. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Domestic revenue mobilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
